{"id":"vod_sn_38904","vodId":"38904","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"希望宅邸","name_cn":"希望宅邸","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/55d5267c093a1d6a831a6caaab47b4ef.jpg"},"summary":"18岁浪人（重考生）由瑠芽从乡下出来寻梦，准备去东京的补习学校进行重读。入住了远离东京城区的“希望宅邸”，这个名为“宅邸”的地方其实只是个虚有其名的破烂公寓。而住在里面的民民全部都是被习生，但大学入学者为零。由瑠芽与川野纱江、田中久实、以及从小就有张大叔脸的松吉这四人，不知道是幸运还是不幸地意气投合，一起过起了“遗忘人生辛劳”的悠闲人生。而努力学习……多半是没有做过的。究竟这四人能不能考进大学呢？本作描写了他们在那样的公寓里悠哉生活的有趣故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T8Zd6atm2s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0bLr4W6xRQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ghfB1R2Kjz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xkf0GMevM61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9xct9CFkD01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Eu8X0ZidxF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sRgMB0TT1k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cv0rs8Je661/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ypYwzZ14J21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c00aEe7U6Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mkVL0k4pbT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W2fVkbCpFH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X7Xr2z2kmr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yBJ1pbKVTb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KmFX5M6twc1/video/index.m